{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The evil necromancer Bobo</strong> is constructing a Big Tower to Heaven to harness it's power and conquer The Realm! Can the creatures of The Realm stop Bobo before its too late?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey begins as Bibi</strong>, the hopeful, fluffy, and surprisingly purple adventurer! Each character you unlock has their own reason for conquering <i>Bobo's Big Tower</i>. Try to beat the final boss of each story line to piece together the full history of the tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/7aee01c328a0a9ab068329cecf9f0567.poster.avif?t=1772553774\" width=576 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/7aee01c328a0a9ab068329cecf9f0567.webm?t=1772553774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Bobo's Big Tower</i> is an action-puzzle game</strong> in a style inspired by the GameBoy Color! Choose from a colorful cast of characters and solve procedurally-generated floors of puzzles to survive the onslaught of Bobo's minions blocking your path! <strong>Time only moves when you do</strong>, so be sure to strategize critically before each move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/43e70cb20bf526486e3f0927f4458b8f.poster.avif?t=1772553774\" width=576 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729890/extras/43e70cb20bf526486e3f0927f4458b8f.webm?t=1772553774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modifiers provide many combinations</strong> of interesting &amp; game-changing challenges to spice up your runs!<br> <br><strong>Every character has their own starter items</strong> and weapon pools to work with throughout each run. Weapons can increase your range, deal physical or magic damage, launch projectiles, and/or even be upgraded!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to collect artifacts</strong> along the way to build synergy with your weapons and play style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows what kinds of challenges await you in the tower?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Learning the Ropes, or something","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729890/4f25f057ceef4a61e47383207a4693073f2f88b6.jpg"},{"name":"Riding the High","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729890/7275c3c109a9a32c8f525d2b6195658b73701ce8.jpg"},{"name":"Finish The Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729890/22a2158e23c5ae84da5d50e2c53d5a909ad8a681.jpg"},{"name":"Shooting Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729890/a80a024ad03291c9ec2d3b37870099d72dc4cfdd.jpg"},{"name":"To Heaven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729890/29bf81386fe919bcf5a188d84db15b18f5c887c7.jpg"},{"name":"Howdy Do, Buckaroo?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729890/7ecf69b73dc15db1b7af04e13d7c31e053b62587.jpg"},{"name":"Brave the Dark","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729890/45d750e85e91843be666cac9bc044b95e6c6897e.jpg"},{"name":"Vital Fundraiser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729890/799d80c108eb56d4652769ed2ac5747741a49625.jpg"},{"name":"Ball Juggler","path":"https://cdn.akama